<!--
    Adaptive icon background — flat brand-blue fill.

    Kept deliberately flat (no gradient/pattern) so it stays legible
    once the OS masks it into a circle, squircle, rounded-square, or
    teardrop depending on the launcher — busy backgrounds tend to look
    noisy once cropped like that.
-->
